トの点数、サイズ、解像度、色数（縦×横cm・pixel／◯dpi／カラー・モノクロ・2C等）\n\n4K 相当以上のサイズを希望します。\n※PC のデスクトップ背景につかいたいので。  \n\n\n## イラストのタッチ…ポートフォリオからイメージに近いものを1〜2点お選びください。\n\n- https://www.foriio.com/works/938036\n- https://www.foriio.com/works/954515\n\n\n## 使用用途\n\n- PC やスマホ等のデスクトップ背景。\n- 可能であれば一部を切り取って各種 SNS のアイコンにも利用したいです。\n\n---\n\n\n何卒よろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 10867, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぐりーんたぬき🍖", "screen_name": "greentanuki64", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1228597893382078465/rftv7mX-.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/72202949/1581756286/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 263850, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "えんがわ🍣skeb open!", "screen_name": "engawa110", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F8f728b08-19a2-4105-829a-adbe7b98fa1f.gif&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/fabc4d71-23dc-476a-8210-af0e559474b3.webp", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 10, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 579204, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "sido魂", "screen_name": "sidotama", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1641846770195124225/yB9d-Pw7.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/